16. 求满足下列关系的点 $z$ 是什么曲线并作图：
(1) $|z - a| = |z - b|$;
(2) $|z - a| + |z - b| = R, R > |b - a|$;
(以上 a, b 为复常数, R 为正实常数)
(3) $\operatorname{Re} \frac{1}{z} = \alpha$; (4) $\arg \frac{z - 1}{z + 1} = \alpha$;
(5) $\left|\frac{z-1}{z+1}\right|=\alpha,\alpha$ 为实常数.
17. 试在复平面上画出满足下列关系的点集的图形, 其中哪些关系确定的点集是区域? 它们的边界是什么?
(1) Rez < 2; (2) Imz ≥ 3;
(3) $|\arg z| < \frac{\pi}{4}$; (4) $\frac{\pi}{4} < \arg z < \frac{\pi}{3}$ 且 $1 < |z| < 2$;
(5)  $0 < \arg(z - i) < \frac{\pi}{6}$ ;
(6) $2 < |z + 1| < 3$ 且 $-2 < \mathrm{Re}z \leqslant \frac{3}{2}$;
(7) $|z| > 2$ 且 $|z - 2| < 2$; (8) $\operatorname{Im} z > 1$ 且 $|z| < 2$;
(9) $y_{1}<\mathrm{Im}z\leqslant y_{2};$ (10) $\left|\frac{z-1}{z+1}\right|>1.$

11. 求满足下列要求的保形变换：
(1) 将扇形  $0 < \arg z < \alpha, |z| < 1$  映为单位圆  $|w| < 1$ ;
(2) 将圆  $\left| z \right| < 1$  映为带域 0 < Imw < 1，且  $w(-1) = \infty, w(1) = \infty, w(i) = i.$
(3) 将第一象限变成上半平面，且使  $z = \sqrt{2}i, 0, 1$  分别变成 w = -1, 1,  $\infty$ ;
(4) 将一个从中心起沿正实轴的半径割开了的单位圆变为上半平面；
(5) 沿线段 $[0,1 + i]$ 有割缝的第一象限变成上半平面.

7. 求下列像函数的本函数：
(1) $\frac{1}{(p+3)(p+1)}$ ;
(2) $\frac{1-p}{p^{3}+p^{2}+p+1};$
(3) $\frac{p+2}{p^{2}+4p+5};$
(4) $\frac{1}{p(p+a)}$ ;
(5) $\frac{1}{p(p-1)(p-2)}$ ;
(6) $\frac{1}{(p^{2}+1)(p^{2}+3)}$ ;
(7) $\frac{1}{p(p-2)(p^{2}+1)}$ ;
(8) $\frac{1}{p(p-2)^{2}}$
(9) $\frac{p+3}{p^{3}+3p^{2}+6p+4}$ ;
(10) $\frac{p}{p^{4}+3p^{2}-4}$ ;
(11) $\frac{1}{p^{4}-3p^{3}+3p^{2}-p}$ ;
(12) $\frac{a^{2}p}{p^{4}+a^{4}}$ ;
(13) $\frac{p^3}{p^4 + a^4}$;
(14) $\frac{1}{(p+1)^{4}};$
(15) $\frac{p-1}{(p^{2}-2p+2)^{2}};$
(16) $\frac{3p + 7}{p^2 + 2p + 1 + a^2}$;
(17) $\frac{p + 2}{p^2 + 1}\mathrm{e}^{-p}$;
(18) $\frac{1-p}{(p+1)(p^{2}+1)}e^{-10p};$
(19) $\frac{1}{p}(1-e^{-3p})$ ;
(20) $\frac{p}{(p^{2}+1)(1+e^{-xp})}.$
8. 利用拉氏变换解下列微分方程
(1) $\left\{ \begin{array}{l} y''(t) + y'(t) = 1 \\ y(0) = y'(0) = 0; \end{array} \right.$
(2) $\left\{ \begin{array}{l} y^{\prime \prime}(t) - y^{\prime}(t) = e^{t} \\ y(0) = y^{\prime}(0) = 0; \end{array} \right.$
(3) $\left\{ \begin{array}{l} y'' - (a + b)y' + aby = 0, a \neq b \\ y(0) = 0, y'(0) = 1; \end{array} \right.$
(4) $\left\{ \begin{array}{l} y'' - 2y' + y = t e' \\ y(0) = y'(0) = 0; \end{array} \right.$
(5) $\left\{\begin{aligned}y^{\prime\prime}-y&=4\sin t+5\cos2t\\ y(0)&=-1,y^{\prime}(0)&=-2;\end{aligned}\right.$
(6) $\left\{\begin{aligned}y^{\prime\prime}-y&=\left\{\begin{aligned}t,&0\leqslant t\leqslant1\\ 1,&t>1\end{aligned}\right.\\ y(0)&=0,y^{\prime}(0)=0;\end{aligned}\right.$
(7) $\left\{ \begin{array}{l} y'' + 3y' + 3y' + y = 6c^{-t} \\ y(0) = y'(0) = y''(0) = 0; \end{array} \right.$
(8) $\left\{ \begin{array}{l} y' + x' = 4y + 1 \\ y' + x = 3y + t^2 \\ y(0) = a, x(0) = b; \end{array} \right.$
$$\left\{ \begin{array}{l} x ^ {\prime} - 2 y ^ {\prime} = \sin t \\ x ^ {\prime} + y ^ {\prime} = \cos t \\ x (0) = 0, y (0) = 1; \end{array} \right. \tag {9}$$
$$\left\{ \begin{array}{l} x ^ {\prime} - y ^ {\prime} = 0 \\ y ^ {\prime} + z ^ {\prime} = 1 \\ x ^ {\prime} - z ^ {\prime} = t \\ x (0) = y (0) = z (0) = 0. \end{array} \right. \tag {10}$$
